[00:00.23]Daisy, Daisy, give me your answer, do
[00:04.61]I'm half crazy, all for the love of you
[00:09.02]It won't be a stylish marriage
[00:12.12]I can't afford a carriage
[00:15.08]But you'll look sweet upon the seat
[00:18.75]Of a bicycle built for two
